# Squash solo - Phase 1 B: Volley & Front Court
@description Solo practice for one court, about 50 minutes: short and ladder volleys, volley
  heights, drops, the serve and length, between rounds of ghosting. Each drill has a target; hit
  every target in two sessions back to back to move up.
@speech rate 1.1
@minimum gap 0:00.8
@workout squash
@artwork ../images/squash.jpg
@include ../shared/squash.overtone

## Intro
Phase one, session B: volleys and the front court. Drills with a phase two target say so. Hit every
target in two sessions back to back to move up.

## Movement warm-up (4 min)
[movement warm-up]

## Figure of eight warm-up (3 min)
[figure of eight]

## Forehand short volleys (2 min)
Forehand short volleys, two minutes. Within two metres of the front wall, on your forehand side, a
metre or so off the side wall. Soft volleys above the service line, hitting each one again before it
bounces. Let it bounce if you lose it.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Racket high. Punch, don't swing.
1:00 Shoulders to the side wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand short volleys (2 min)
Backhand short volleys, two minutes. Within two metres of the front wall, on your backhand side, a
metre or so off the side wall. Soft volleys above the service line, hitting each one again before it
bounces. Let it bounce if you lose it.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Racket high. Punch, then extend up.
1:00 Firm wrist.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: volley positions (3 min)
Ghosting, volley positions, three minutes. Slow pace, with the stance in each call. Closed is a step
across with your far foot. Open is one step with your near foot, and comes quicker, like a rushed
ball. Volley on the beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [slow stance middle]
0:50 Rest. Racket up, ready for the volley.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:05 @random{fill, no repeats} [slow stance middle]
1:54 Rest. Backhand in an open stance? Rotate more.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:09 @random{fill, no repeats} [slow stance middle]
---
[stop]

## Forehand to backhand volleys (3 min)
Forehand to backhand volleys, three minutes. In the middle, two metres from the front wall: forehand
across to your backhand, backhand back across, hitting around the service line just off centre. Let
it bounce for the first half. Phase two target: twenty volleys in one rally, without a break.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Short swings. Racket up early.
1:30 Now on the volley. Target: twenty without a break. Lose it? Restart with a bounce, and count from zero.
2:20 Keep the rhythm. Watch the ball.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

// The ladder volleys are played from the line of the player's current volley ladder level, so the
// session moves back with the ladder.
## Forehand ladder volleys (2 min)
Forehand ladder volleys, two minutes. Behind the tape for your volley ladder level: halfway to the
short line, three-quarters of the way, or the short line itself. A metre or so off the side wall,
volleying above the service line without a bounce. Let it bounce if you lose it. Phase two target:
twenty without a break from the three-quarter line.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Racket above the ball. Come down on it.
1:00 Follow through to the front wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand ladder volleys (2 min)
Backhand ladder volleys, two minutes. Behind the tape for your volley ladder level: halfway to the
short line, three-quarters of the way, or the short line itself. A metre or so off the side wall,
volleying above the service line without a bounce. Let it bounce if you lose it. Phase two target:
twenty without a break from the three-quarter line.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Racket high. Punch.
1:00 Shoulders to the side wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Forehand volley heights (2 min)
Forehand volley heights, two minutes. Halfway between the front wall and the short line, a metre off
the side wall. Three straight volleys in turn: just above the service line, on it, then just above
the tin. After the low one, let it bounce and start again.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Above the line. On the line. Above the tin.
0:55 Same punch every time. Only the target changes.
1:30 Racket above the ball. Come down on it.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand volley heights (2 min)
Backhand volley heights, two minutes. Halfway between the front wall and the short line, a metre off
the side wall. Three straight volleys in turn: just above the service line, on it, then just above
the tin. After the low one, let it bounce and start again.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Above the line. On the line. Above the tin.
0:55 Same punch every time. Only the target changes.
1:30 Racket high. Firm wrist.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: front corners with drops (3 min)
Ghosting, front corners with drops, three minutes. Medium pace. Lunge closed and play a soft shadow
drop on the beep, then get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
0:47 Rest. Racket up early. Open face.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:02 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
1:48 Rest. Stay low through the lunge.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:03 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
---
[stop]

## Forehand drops (2 min)
Forehand drops, two minutes. Two halves. First, counter-drops: two metres from the front wall, close
to the side wall, soft drops just above the tin, kept going. Then feed from just behind the short
line, play one drop, and let it go. Phase two target: six out of ten with the second bounce before
the short line, misses in between allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Open face. Soft hands.
1:00 Now feed, drop, and let it go. Score ten.
1:30 Step in with your front foot. Stay low.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand drops (2 min)
Backhand drops, two minutes. Two halves. First, counter-drops: two metres from the front wall, close
to the side wall, soft drops just above the tin, kept going. Then feed from just behind the short
line, play one drop, and let it go. Phase two target: six out of ten with the second bounce before
the short line, misses in between allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Open face. Soft hands.
1:00 Now feed, drop, and let it go. Score ten.
1:30 Step in with your front foot. Stay low.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Serve then T (3 min)
Serve then T, three minutes. Start in the right box. After each serve, move to the T and split step,
ready to volley the return. Switch boxes halfway.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Aim just left of centre, so it touches the side wall.
1:30 Switch to the left box. Aim just right of centre.
2:10 Split step. Ready to volley.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Forehand length check (2 min)
Forehand length check, two minutes. Straight drives to length from behind the short line: a racket
head above the service line, first bounce behind the service box. Score each set of ten by how many
bounce first behind the short line. Reset with a softer one whenever you need to. Resets don't
count. Phase two target: eight out of ten, misses in between allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Racket up early. Finish high.
1:10 Count them. Target: eight out of ten.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand length check (2 min)
Backhand length check, two minutes. Straight drives to length from behind the short line: a racket
head above the service line, first bounce behind the service box. Score each set of ten by how many
bounce first behind the short line. Reset with a softer one whenever you need to. Resets don't
count. Phase two target: eight out of ten, misses in between allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Racket up early. Finish high.
1:10 Count them. Target: eight out of ten.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: six points (3 min)
Ghosting, six points, three minutes. Fast pace, all six positions. Phase two target: every rep at
the beep with a full swish, and form that holds to the last round. Split step on every call, swing
on the beep, and sprint back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
0:33 Rest. Stay engaged. Low and wide at the T.
-0:03 [countdown]
0:48 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
1:20 Rest. Feet pointing forward. Knees bent.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:35 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
2:07 Rest. Last round. Stay engaged.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:22 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
---
[stop]

## Cool-down (3 min)
[cool-down]

## Finish
+0:01.5 That's session B. Well done.
--- 0:01
